            description: "This variety is a hybrid of 'Seckel' x ('Vermont Beauty' x 'Roi Charles de Waurtemburg') and was patented by Stark Brothers Nurseries in 1979. The large fruit is covered with golden russet and ripens in late August. The flesh is smooth, and buttery with no grit. The flavor is rich, sweet and similar to 'Seckel'."
        },
        {
            type: "Euro Pear",
            name: "Moonglow",
            category: "European pear varieties described for Virginia",
